{"id":"shewbread","en":"Shewbread","ru":"Хлебы предложения","lines":[{"l":1,"t":"Twelve cakes of fine flour","r":["LEV 24:5"]},{"l":1,"t":"Called hallowed bread","r":["1SA 21:4"]},{"l":1,"t":"Materials for, provided by the people","r":["LEV 24:8","NEH 10:32","NEH 10:33"]},{"l":1,"t":"Prepared by Levites","r":["1CH 9:32","1CH 23:29"]},{"l":1,"t":"Placed in two rows on the table by the priests","r":["EXO 25:30","EXO 40:23","LEV 24:6"]},{"l":1,"t":"Table of","r":[]},{"l":2,"t":"Dimensions of","r":["EXO 25:23"]},{"l":2,"t":"Covered with gold","r":["EXO 25:24"]},{"l":2,"t":"Had an ornamental border","r":["EXO 25:25"]},{"l":2,"t":"Had staves of shittim wood covered with gold","r":["EXO 25:28"]},{"l":2,"t":"Had rings of gold in the corners for the staves","r":["EXO 25:26","EXO 25:27"]},{"l":2,"t":"Had dishes, spoons, covers, and bowls of gold","r":["EXO 25:29"]},{"l":2,"t":"Placed in the north side of the tabernacle","r":["EXO 40:22","HEB 9:2"]},{"l":2,"t":"Directions for removing","r":["NUM 4:7"]},{"l":1,"t":"Pure frankincense placed on","r":["LEV 24:7"]},{"l":1,"t":"Was changed every Sabbath day","r":["LEV 24:8"]},{"l":1,"t":"After removal from the table given to the priests","r":["LEV 24:9"]},{"l":1,"t":"Not lawful for any but the priests to eat, except in extreme cases","r":["1SA 21:4-6","MAT 12:4"]},{"l":1,"t":"Illustrative of","r":[]},{"l":2,"t":"Christ as the bread of life","r":["JHN 6:48"]},{"l":2,"t":"The Church","r":["1CO 5:7","1CO 10:17"]}]}
